  "description": "AtpClient is an Elixir client library for external automated theorem provers. It provides a uniform interface to multiple backends (SystemOnTPTP, StarExec, Isabelle, and locally installed TPTP-compliant binaries) and normalises all results to standardised SZS status verdicts, enabling straightforward cross-prover comparison.",
